{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026A6Co3PFjil1793282109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在菲律賓舉行的東盟防長擴大會議，中方由駐菲律賓使館國防武官作為代表，防長未有出席。國防部表示是菲方阻礙中方參會。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.PHIL-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269GfPYy2xUx1793282118.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>國防部發言人張曉剛說：「菲方放任個別政客，肆意妄為、公器私用，重重設障阻礙中方參會，嚴重破壞東盟協商一致原則，嚴重違背東盟防長擴大會開放包容精神，不符合基本外交禮儀，損害中方作為機制成員的正當權利。」</p><p></p><p>發言人表示，在這個情況下，中國仍決定派員參加，體現了堅定支持東盟中心地位，及對地區防務安全合作的負責任態度。</p><p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.767868+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:18:08.394819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:30.720835+00:00","content_hash":"c56ceabbcc7d68d3afde7871e3802356b706f0b309d8da477041ebb8fe33d035","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.767868+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}